1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,050
Why do I bob my head? I'm not dancing. Mostly.

2
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:13,050
My head holds still while my body catches up.

3
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:19,050
That keeps the picture steady, like a tripod.

4
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:25,050
My eyes are on the sides. I see almost all around.

5
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:28,550
Yes, I'm judging you from every angle.
